{"pack": "star_wars", "title": "The Rule of Two", "url": "https://starwars.fandom.com/wiki/The_Rule_of_Two", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"title-eraicons\" style=\"float:right;position:static;display:none\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars_Legends\" title=\"This article details a subject that falls under the Legends continuity.\"><img alt=\"This article details a subject that falls under the Legends continuity.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/a/a9/Premium-Eras-legends.png/revision/latest?cb=20170617140552\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"112\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Premium-Eras-legends.png\" data-image-key=\"Premium-Eras-legends.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span></div><p><span class=\"mobileTopIcons\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars_Legends\" title=\"Star Wars Legends\"><img alt=\"OnALegendsArticle\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/d/d6/OnALegendsArticle.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20250314035545\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"41\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"OnALegendsArticle.png\" data-image-key=\"OnALegendsArticle.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span></span>\n</p><div class=\"disambig noprint darkbackground1\" style=\"border-radius: 10px; padding: 5px 0\">For other uses, see <b><a href=\"/wiki/Rule_of_Two_(disambiguation)\" class=\"mw-disambig\" title=\"Rule of Two (disambiguation)\">Rule of Two</a></b>.</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-IU-media pi-layout-default\">\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/4/4c/Rule_of_Two_flyleaf.png/revision/latest?cb=20130923013839\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Rule of Two flyleaf\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/4/4c/Rule_of_Two_flyleaf.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/500?cb=20130923013839\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/4/4c/Rule_of_Two_flyleaf.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/500?cb=20130923013839 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/4/4c/Rule_of_Two_flyleaf.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/998?cb=20130923013839 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Rule of Two flyleaf\" width=\"270\" height=\"236\" data-image-key=\"Rule_of_Two_flyleaf.png\" data-image-name=\"Rule of Two flyleaf.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\"><i>The Rule of Two</i></h2>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\" data-item-name=\"mobile-eras\"><center></center></nav>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-open\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Attribution information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"author\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Author(s)</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darth_Bane/Legends\" title=\"Darth Bane/Legends\">Darth Bane</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOS&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOS-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-open\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Publication information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"media type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Philosophy essay<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOS&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOS-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"published in\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Published in</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Between <a href=\"/wiki/1000_BBY/Legends\" title=\"1000 BBY/Legends\">1000 BBY</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-NECBattle&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-NECBattle-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>&#8211;<a href=\"/wiki/980_BBY\" title=\"980 BBY\">980 BBY</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-DoE&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-DoE-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><small><span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://starwars.fandom.com/wiki/Template:IU_media\">[Source]</a></span></small></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><span>\"<i>The Force is not fire, it is venom.</i>\"</span></dd>\n<dd>&#8213;Darth Bane<span class=\"noprint\"><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOS&#95;1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOS-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></span></dd></dl></div>\n<p><i><b>The Rule of Two</b></i> was an essay pertaining to an <a href=\"/wiki/Rule_of_Two/Legends\" title=\"Rule of Two/Legends\">eponymous doctrine</a> authored by the <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Lord_of_the_Sith/Legends\" title=\"Dark Lord of the Sith/Legends\">Dark Lord of the Sith</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Darth_Bane/Legends\" title=\"Darth Bane/Legends\">Darth Bane</a> some time after the <a href=\"/wiki/Seventh_Battle_of_Ruusan\" title=\"Seventh Battle of Ruusan\">Seventh Battle</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Ruusan/Legends\" title=\"Ruusan/Legends\">Ruusan</a>. It became the cornerstone of Bane's <a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_the_Sith_Lords\" title=\"Order of the Sith Lords\">reformed Sith Order</a> and was passed down from <a href=\"/wiki/Sith_Master/Legends\" title=\"Sith Master/Legends\">master</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Sith_apprentice/Legends\" title=\"Sith apprentice/Legends\">apprentice</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Sith_archives/Legends\" title=\"Sith archives/Legends\">Sith Archives</a>. It was eventually included in <a href=\"/wiki/Palpatine/Legends\" title=\"Palpatine/Legends\">Darth Sidious's</a> <i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Sith\" title=\"Book of Sith\">Book of Sith</a></i> sometime after the end of the <a href=\"/wiki/Clone_Wars/Legends\" title=\"Clone Wars/Legends\">Clone Wars</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Chapters\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Chapters</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Sources\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Sources</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Notes_and_references\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes and references</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><span>\"<i>This is the Rule of Two: One Sith must contain all the power of the dark side. One Master must decide how that power should be used.</i>\"</span></dd>\n<dd>&#8213;Darth Bane<span class=\"noprint\"><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOS&#95;1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOS-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></span></dd></dl></div>\n<p>In <a href=\"/wiki/1000_BBY/Legends\" title=\"1000 BBY/Legends\">1000 BBY</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Brotherhood_of_Darkness/Legends\" title=\"Brotherhood of Darkness/Legends\">Brotherhood of Darkness</a>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Sith/Legends\" title=\"Sith/Legends\">Sith</a> organization founded and led by <a href=\"/wiki/Lord/Legends\" title=\"Lord/Legends\">Lord</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Skere_Kaan\" title=\"Skere Kaan\">Skere Kaan</a>, was defeated by the <a href=\"/wiki/Jedi_Order/Legends\" title=\"Jedi Order/Legends\">Jedi Order</a> during the <a href=\"/wiki/Seventh_Battle_of_Ruusan\" title=\"Seventh Battle of Ruusan\">Seventh Battle</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Ruusan/Legends\" title=\"Ruusan/Legends\">Ruusan</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-NEC&#95;4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-NEC-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <a href=\"/wiki/Darth_Bane/Legends\" title=\"Darth Bane/Legends\">Darth Bane</a>, the last surviving <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Lord_of_the_Sith/Legends\" title=\"Dark Lord of the Sith/Legends\">Dark Lord</a>, decided to restructure the Sith into a <a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_the_Sith_Lords\" title=\"Order of the Sith Lords\">new order</a>, in which the practices of the Brotherhood were replaced with his own system, the <a href=\"/wiki/Rule_of_Two/Legends\" title=\"Rule of Two/Legends\">Rule of Two</a>. To assert his views, Bane wrote <i>The Rule of Two</i>, a source book detailing his eponymous Sith philosophy.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOS&#95;1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOS-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>That document was conserved in the hidden <a href=\"/wiki/Sith_archives/Legends\" title=\"Sith archives/Legends\">Sith Archives</a> and was passed down from <a href=\"/wiki/Sith_Master/Legends\" title=\"Sith Master/Legends\">master</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Sith_apprentice/Legends\" title=\"Sith apprentice/Legends\">apprentice</a> for <a href=\"/wiki/Standard_century/Legends\" title=\"Standard century/Legends\">centuries</a>. In the last decades of the <a href=\"/wiki/Galactic_Republic/Legends\" title=\"Galactic Republic/Legends\">Galactic Republic</a>, it fell into the hands of <a href=\"/wiki/Palpatine/Legends\" title=\"Palpatine/Legends\">Darth Sidious</a>, the Sith alter ego of the <a href=\"/wiki/Politics/Legends\" title=\"Politics/Legends\">politician</a> Palpatine. After the start of the <a href=\"/wiki/Clone_Wars/Legends\" title=\"Clone Wars/Legends\">Clone Wars</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOS&#95;1-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOS-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> in <a href=\"/wiki/22_BBY/Legends\" title=\"22 BBY/Legends\">22 BBY</a>,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-NEC&#95;4-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-NEC-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <i>The Rule of Two</i> was handed to the <a href=\"/wiki/Count/Legends\" title=\"Count/Legends\">Count</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Dooku/Legends\" title=\"Dooku/Legends\">Dooku</a>, a fallen <a href=\"/wiki/Jedi_Master/Legends\" title=\"Jedi Master/Legends\">Jedi Master</a> who had become Sidious' apprentice under the name of Darth Tyranus. He shared this text with the <a href=\"/wiki/Kiffar/Legends\" title=\"Kiffar/Legends\">Kiffar</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Jedi_Knight/Legends\" title=\"Jedi Knight/Legends\">Jedi Knight</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Quinlan_Vos/Legends\" title=\"Quinlan Vos/Legends\">Quinlan Vos</a> in an attempt to lure and corrupt him. Vos left many annotations in the margins.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOS&#95;1-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOS-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Following the end of the Clone Wars<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOS&#95;1-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOS-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> in <a href=\"/wiki/19_BBY/Legends\" title=\"19 BBY/Legends\">19 BBY</a>,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-NEC&#95;4-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-NEC-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Darth Sidious compiled various seminal Sith texts into his <i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Sith\" title=\"Book of Sith\">Book of Sith</a></i>, and he included Bane's text amongst its sections. It should be noted that Sidious also scrawled notes of his own across the pages.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOS&#95;1-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOS-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 130px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/2/2f/Bane.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20151109015836\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Darth Bane, the author of The Rule of Two\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/2/2f/Bane.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/130?cb=20151109015836\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"130\" height=\"265\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Bane.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Bane.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Bane.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Darth Bane, the author of <i>The Rule of Two</i></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<ul><li><i>Power of the Sith</i></li>\n<li><i>The Mistakes of Ruusan</i></li>\n<li><i>The Title of Darth</i></li>\n<li><i>Striking from the Shadows</i></li>\n<li><i>Selecting an Apprentice</i></li>\n<li><i>The Revenge of the Sith</i></li>\n<li><i>Personal Combat</i></li>\n<li><i>Lightsaber Construction</i></li>\n<li><i>Sith Lightsaber Variants</i></li>\n<li><i>Lightsaber Combat</i></li>\n<li><i>Using the Saberstaff</i></li>\n<li><i>Sith Armor</i></li>\n<li><i>Dark Side Combat</i></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources\">Sources</span></h2>\n<ul><li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_Book_of_Sith\" title=\"Star Wars: Book of Sith\">Star Wars: Book of Sith</a></i> <small>(First appearance)</small></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes_and_references\">Notes and references</span></h2>\n<div class=\"references-small\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-BOS-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-BOS_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-BOS_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-BOS_1-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-BOS_1-3\">1.3</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-BOS_1-4\">1.4</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-BOS_1-5\">1.5</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-BOS_1-6\">1.6</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-BOS_1-7\">1.7</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-BOS_1-8\">1.8</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_Book_of_Sith\" title=\"Star Wars: Book of Sith\">Star Wars: Book of Sith</a></i></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-NECBattle-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-NECBattle_2-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">The <a href=\"/wiki/Seventh_Battle_of_Ruusan\" title=\"Seventh Battle of Ruusan\">Seventh Battle</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Ruusan/Legends\" title=\"Ruusan/Legends\">Ruusan</a> happened in <a href=\"/wiki/1000_BBY/Legends\" title=\"1000 BBY/Legends\">1000 BBY</a> according to <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_New_Essential_Chronology\" title=\"The New Essential Chronology\">The New Essential Chronology</a></i>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-DoE-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-DoE_3-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">The novel <i><a href=\"/wiki/Darth_Bane:_Dynasty_of_Evil\" title=\"Darth Bane: Dynasty of Evil\">Darth Bane: Dynasty of Evil</a></i>, states that <a href=\"/wiki/Darth_Bane/Legends\" title=\"Darth Bane/Legends\">Darth Bane</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Death/Legends\" title=\"Death/Legends\">died</a> twenty <a href=\"/wiki/Standard_year/Legends\" title=\"Standard year/Legends\">years</a> after the <a href=\"/wiki/Seventh_Battle_of_Ruusan\" title=\"Seventh Battle of Ruusan\">Seventh Battle</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Ruusan/Legends\" title=\"Ruusan/Legends\">Ruusan</a>, which occurred in <a href=\"/wiki/1000_BBY/Legends\" title=\"1000 BBY/Legends\">1000 BBY</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-NEC-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-NEC_4-0\">4.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-NEC_4-1\">4.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-NEC_4-2\">4.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/The_New_Essential_Chronology\" title=\"The New Essential Chronology\">The New Essential Chronology</a></i>.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div></div>"}